<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-protection-warrior-tank">Trinkets for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77983/indomitable-pride">
<img alt="Indomitable Pride" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_rebirth.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Indomitable Pride</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77970/soulshifter-vortex">
<img alt="Soulshifter Vortex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_cyclone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soulshifter Vortex</span></a> are a significant step up from all the trinkets previously available in Cataclysm, including the ilvl 391 trinkets from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a>, and should be your first purchase with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>.<br/>They are amazing equip-and-forget trinkets with very high stamina ideal for all incoming damage types, paired with passive effects that you never have to think about. The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77983/indomitable-pride">
<img alt="Indomitable Pride" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_rebirth.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Indomitable Pride</span></a> in particular is the best emergency proc a tank could hope for at this late stage of the game when bosses hit like trucks.<div class="pad"></div>
